      "body": "+1，同样遇到此问题，用数据线连接手机，在此电脑界面没有手机盘，无法读写内容。\n\n<img width=\"1226\" height=\"756\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd455d38-49e9-459f-9a08-666a45bb438f\" />\n可以对比一下系统自带的资源管理器，是可以显示的。\n\n<img width=\"1027\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/baca1e9c-bab7-4860-b862-dff0cfedb57e\" />\n\n另外，右键菜单里缺少“发送到”，有些软件想给桌面发送给快捷方式，还需要从桌面手动添加。\n\n<img width=\"572\" height=\"602\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5100792-9519-42d6-bea3-287e98f54021\" />",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">+1，同样遇到此问题，用数据线连接手机，在此电脑界面没有手机盘，无法读写内容。</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671836198-cd455d38-49e9-459f-9a08-666a45bb438f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QkyJFPJqyTJwbmjuvPbpTCscxDA8MAuk3pw0g2VjAN8\"><img width=\"1226\" height=\"756\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671836198-cd455d38-49e9-459f-9a08-666a45bb438f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QkyJFPJqyTJwbmjuvPbpTCscxDA8MAuk3pw0g2VjAN8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 756px;; aspect-ratio: 1226 / 756; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n可以对比一下系统自带的资源管理器，是可以显示的。\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671836974-baca1e9c-bab7-4860-b862-dff0cfedb57e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..qMZwhxIF4AYiXLeMmhBhXO-wcaZv4glPLHJw0zOrS0I\"><img width=\"1027\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671836974-baca1e9c-bab7-4860-b862-dff0cfedb57e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..qMZwhxIF4AYiXLeMmhBhXO-wcaZv4glPLHJw0zOrS0I\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 658px;; aspect-ratio: 1027 / 658; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">另外，右键菜单里缺少“发送到”，有些软件想给桌面发送给快捷方式，还需要从桌面手动添加。</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671838542-e5100792-9519-42d6-bea3-287e98f54021.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ZRscjulTW2A0TjKYzs6EkAYSbfKyBMW0dr9SMAOge4Q\"><img width=\"572\" height=\"602\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4044790/671838542-e5100792-9519-42d6-bea3-287e98f54021.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ZRscjulTW2A0TjKYzs6EkAYSbfKyBMW0dr9SMAOge4Q\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 602px;; aspect-ratio: 572 / 602; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
